       "notes": "<span class=\"vault-tag\">🎬 Watch</span><h4>Follow along</h4><p>Same product, no human in frame. This is the faster, higher-margin format, and the one most brands ask for first.</p><div class=\"vault-action\"><b>Action step:</b> make one for your own product before Module 4.</div>"
