    {
     "key": "aiv-m4",
     "title": "Module 4 · Build Your Portfolio",
     "lessons": [
      {
       "key": "aiv-4_1",
       "n": "4.1",
       "title": "The Four Tasks That Become Your Portfolio",
       "dur": "10 min",
       "video": true,
       "aspect": "16:9",
       "notes": "<span class=\"vault-tag\">🎬 Watch</span><h4>The Idea</h4><p>You now know how to make the work. A client cannot see what you know — they can only see what you've made. These four tasks exist to turn the last two modules into something you can send someone.</p><p>Do them in order. Each one takes roughly an hour once you've done Modules 2 and 3.</p><h4>Task 1 — The Testimonial</h4><p>Pick the product you chose in Module 1. Make a <b class=\"vault-hl\">15-second AI UGC testimonial</b>: a person holding it, talking to camera, one clear benefit, soft recommendation at the end.</p><ul><li>Captions burned in.</li><li>Vertical 9:16.</li><li>A real trending sound underneath.</li></ul><div class=\"wk-call\">✅ Done when: someone scrolling past would not stop to wonder whether it's AI.</div><h4>Task 2 — The Product Film, No Person</h4><p>Same product, no human at all. The object moving — rotating, opening, splashing, catching light. This is the Module 3 workflow.</p><ul><li>5-8 seconds is plenty.</li><li>One camera move, not three.</li><li>End on the product held still, so a logo could sit over it.</li></ul><div class=\"wk-call\">✅ Done when: it would work as the first 3 seconds of a paid ad.</div><h4>Task 3 — The Pack Of Three</h4><p>Now the thing you'll actually sell. Same brand, three clips: one testimonial, one product film, one \"before and after\" or demo. This is what a ₦60,000-120,000 package looks like.</p><ul><li>Same face across all three if a person appears — consistency is what makes it look like a brand and not three experiments.</li><li>Same colours, same captions style, same sound family.</li></ul><div class=\"wk-call\">✅ Done when: the three sit together and look like one campaign.</div><h4>Task 4 — The Real Pitch</h4><p>Take the three brands you wrote down in Module 1. Pick the one you'd most like to work with. Make them <b class=\"vault-hl\">one custom clip using their actual product</b>, then send it — unasked, free, with no long message attached.</p><div class=\"wk-call\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Hi [name] 👋\n\nI make advert videos for [product type] with no shoot — no models, no studio, 48-hour turnaround.\n\nI made this one for [their product] already, no charge. Thought you'd want to see it.\n\n[attach the video]</div><p>That's it. No pricing until they reply. No paragraph about AI.</p><div class=\"wk-call\">✅ Done when: it's sent. Not drafted — sent.</div><h4>Where These Go</h4><ul><li>Upload all of them to a Google Drive folder set to \"anyone with the link\".</li><li>Post the best two on your Instagram or WhatsApp status — this is how the first inbound job usually arrives.</li><li>Keep the pack of three as your portfolio link. It's what you paste into every pitch from now on.</li></ul><div class=\"vault-action\"><b>Action step:</b> finish Task 1 today, before the motivation fades. The other three get easier once one exists.</div>"
      }
     ]
    }
